<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Toxic Bite</ansi> mutation

Venom sacs have developed in your jaw, connected to elongated canines
that can deliver a potent toxin. The mutation warps your face into
something bestial and unsettling.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Mouth (fanged jaw)
<parameter name="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active Ability
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Active ability: bite a target to inject a potent venom that
  poisons them over time

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Greatly reduced charisma — the elongated fangs and unhinged jaw
  are deeply disturbing to behold

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Clawed Hands

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
